### 6.3 Replicat configuration

```text
REPLICAT REPTRDS3

TARGETDB LIBFILE libggjava.so
SET property=/path/REPTRDS3.properties

GROUPTRANSOPS 5000

MAP TRADE.EXECUTIONS, TARGET TRADE.EXECUTIONS;
MAP TRADE.ORDERS, TARGET TRADE.ORDERS;
MAP TRADE.TRADES, TARGET TRADE.TRADES;
MAP TRADE.FILLS, TARGET TRADE.FILLS;
MAP TRADE.POSITIONS, TARGET TRADE.POSITIONS;
MAP TRADE.SETTLEMENTS, TARGET TRADE.SETTLEMENTS;
```

